flowchart TD
A["**Start**<br/>Initiates the MOO flow that tunes buffers using the simulation model"]
B["**NSGA II Setup**<br/>Configures the optimization run with population size generations sampling SBX crossover and mutation PM and termination by n_gen"]
C["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Represents the 3 buffer capacity decision variables and 2 objectives<br/>Attributes n_var 3 n_obj 2 xl {1-10} xu {1-10} n_replications 5 base_seed 99 n_cores 1<br/>Methods _evaluate"]
D["**Initial Sampling**<br/>Generates initial population for buffers using integer sampling in {1-10}"]
E["**Evaluate Generation**<br/>Evaluates each candidate with parallel tasks using evaluate_single_individual across CPU cores"]
F["**Evaluate Single Individual**<br/>Runs multiple replications via run_simulation and aggregates results<br/>Returns objectives wip and negative throughput"]
G["**Run Simulation**<br/>Executes the manufacturing model using SimPy components such as DelayBuffer and Machine<br/>Returns metrics including throughput and wip"]
H["**NSGA II Update**<br/>Applies selection and genetic operators SBX crossover and PM mutation to create a new population"]
I["**Termination Check**<br/>If generation count reached stop else continue to evaluation"]
J["**Export Results**<br/>Writes feasible solutions and KPIs to CSV using export_history_to_csv"]
K["**End**<br/>Optimization finished and results stored"]
A --> B
B --> C
C --> D
D --> E
E --> F
F --> G
G --> H
H --> I
I --> E
I -->|finish| J
J --> K